</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 antialiased py-10 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <!-- Top Actions Bar -->
        <div class="no-print mb-8 p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <img src="/storage/system/logo.png" alt="HafizPlus Logo" class="h-10 w-10 object-contain rounded-xl bg-slate-900 p-1.5 shadow">
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-base font-extrabold text-slate-900">HafizPlus School Platform</h2>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Dokumentasi & Katalog Fitur Lengkap per Menu</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 w-full sm:w-auto">
                <a href="/panduan_fitur_dan_menu_hafizplus.md" download="panduan_fitur_dan_menu_hafizplus.md" class="flex-1 sm:flex-none text-center px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 rounded-xl transition border border-slate-300">
                    📥 Download Markdown (.md)
                </a>
                <button onclick="window.print()" class="flex-1 sm:flex-none px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold text-white bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 rounded-xl shadow-md transition flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5">
                    🖨️ Cetak / Simpan PDF
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Main Content Document -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 border border-slate-200/90 shadow-xl">
            <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 border-b pb-4 mb-6 mt-8 flex items-center gap-3">Panduan Lengkap Fitur per Menu: HafizPlus School Platform</h1><p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-3 leading-relaxed">Dokumen ini memuat seluruh daftar modul dan submenu yang ada pada sidebar aplikasi **HafizPlus**, lengkap dengan fungsi spesifik masing-masing menu serta relasi dan integrasi datanya dengan modul lain.</p><hr class="my-6 border-slate-200"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-50/80 border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl mb-4 mt-8 flex items-center gap-2">1. Menu: Dashboard</h2><ul class="space-y-4 mb-6"><li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Dashboard Utama (`/dashboard`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Titik masuk utama (*smart redirector*) yang secara otomatis mengarahkan pengguna ke ringkasan kerja sesuai dengan peran akun (*Super Admin, Admin Sekolah, Kepala Sekolah, Guru, Orang Tua, Santri, Kasir, Bagian Keuangan, atau Tim SaaS-Ops*).</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Mengagregasi metrik cepat dari Data Master, Tahfizh, Keuangan, dan Presensi.</li></ul><hr class="my-6 border-slate-200"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-50/80 border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl mb-4 mt-8 flex items-center gap-2">2. Menu: Al-Qur&#039;an Mushaf</h2><ul class="space-y-4 mb-6"><li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Al-Qur&#039;an Mushaf Digital &amp; PDF (`/mushaf`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Menyediakan mushaf Al-Qur&#039;an 30 juz interaktif lengkap dengan navigasi surah/ayat, terjemahan Kemenag RI, audio murottal per ayat, dan penampil (*viewer*) PDF Mushaf standar Rasm Utsmani Madinah 15 baris.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> <div class="ml-4 mt-1 text-xs text-indigo-800 list-disc flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-400"></span>**Setoran Tahfizh**: Menjadi rujukan pembacaan ayat dan batas halaman saat guru menyimak setoran.</div><div class="ml-4 mt-1 text-xs text-indigo-800 list-disc flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-400"></span>**Target Tahfizh**: Menentukan batas awal (*surah/ayat/halaman*) dan batas akhir target hafalan.</div><div class="ml-4 mt-1 text-xs text-indigo-800 list-disc flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-400"></span>**AI Learning**: Menghubungkan rekomendasi latihan muraja&#039;ah langsung ke teks ayat terkait.</div></li></ul><hr class="my-6 border-slate-200"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-50/80 border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl mb-4 mt-8 flex items-center gap-2">3. Menu: SchoolOS</h2><ul class="space-y-4 mb-6"><li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Dashboard SchoolOS (`/schoolos`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Pusat kendali kesehatan operasional sekolah, ringkasan integrasi modul aktif, dan pencarian cepat data santri/guru secara global.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Menghubungkan seluruh modul inti ke dalam satu arsitektur terintegrasi.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Tahun Ajaran (`/schoolos/academic-years`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Mengatur kalender tahun ajaran (contoh: 2026/2027), status semester ganjil/genap, dan tanggal mulai/selesai periode belajar.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Menjadi filter periode waktu untuk Tagihan Keuangan, Penetapan Target Tahfizh, Asesmen Tahsin, dan Raport.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Module Registry (`/schoolos/modules`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Katalog status aktivasi seluruh modul sistem (inti dan opsional) pada instalasi platform.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Terkoneksi dengan Paket Langganan (Billing) dan Tenant Modules.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>School Settings (`/schoolos/settings`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Konfigurasi parameter umum sekolah seperti nama resmi, NPSN, nomor kontak, alamat, dan zona waktu.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Digunakan pada kop cetak dokumen di Laporan Tahfizh, Kwitansi Keuangan, dan Kartu QR Santri.</li></ul><hr class="my-6 border-slate-200"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-50/80 border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl mb-4 mt-8 flex items-center gap-2">4. Menu: Data Master</h2><ul class="space-y-4 mb-6"><li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Sekolah (`/master-data/schools`) *[Khusus Super Admin]*</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Manajemen multi-sekolah/cabang pesantren yang terdaftar pada ekosistem platform.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Entitas induk (*tenant*) yang menaungi seluruh data kelas, guru, santri, dan transaksi.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Kelola User (`/master-data/users`) *[Khusus Super Admin]*</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Manajemen seluruh akun login sistem, pembuatan kredensial, penugasan role, dan reset kata sandi.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Menjadi akun autentikasi untuk mengakses Portal Guru, Wali, Santri, dan Admin.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Kelas / Halaqah (`/master-data/class-rooms`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Mengelola rombongan belajar kelas akademik maupun kelompok halaqah Al-Qur&#039;an.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Menjadi pengelompokan data santri pada Tahfizh, Presensi, LMS, dan Asrama.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Guru / Asatidz (`/master-data/teachers`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Mengelola biodata ustadz/ustadzah, NIP, spesialisasi pengajaran, dan penugasan wali kelas/pembina halaqah.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Memberikan otorisasi penginputan pada Setoran Tahfizh, Tahsin, Presensi, dan Instruktur LMS.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Siswa / Santri (`/master-data/students`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Mengelola biodata santri (NISN, NIS, tanggal lahir, wali murid, status aktif/alumni).</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Entitas sentral yang terhubung ke Student 360° Profile, Tahfizh, Presensi, Keuangan, Dompet Cashless, dan Kamar Asrama.</li></ul><hr class="my-6 border-slate-200"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-50/80 border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl mb-4 mt-8 flex items-center gap-2">5. Menu: Branding &amp; Tenancy</h2><ul class="space-y-4 mb-6"><li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Tenant Dashboard (`/tenancy`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Ringkasan status tenancy, lisensi domain, dan identitas tenant yang sedang aktif.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Terhubung dengan SchoolOS dan Paket Langganan.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Ganti Sekolah (`/tenancy/switch`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Fitur *Tenant Switcher* untuk berpindah konteks antar-cabang sekolah tanpa perlu login ulang.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Memperbarui variabel sesi `active_school_id` untuk seluruh modul lainnya.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>User Memberships (`/tenancy/memberships`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Mengatur keanggotaan pengguna lintas sekolah dan menentukan sekolah default.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Terhubung ke Master User dan hak akses multi-sekolah.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Tenant Settings (`/tenancy/settings`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Pengaturan preferensi teknis spesifik tenant (format nomor tagihan, kebijakan PIN dompet, kuota setoran).</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Menjadi variabel konfigurasi bagi Finance dan Cashless.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Tenant Modules (`/tenancy/modules`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Memantau modul apa saja yang aktif pada sekolah yang bersangkutan berdasarkan paket langganan.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Terhubung langsung ke ModuleAccessService dan Billing.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>White-Label Builder (`/white-label`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Pengaturan visual sekolah (unggah Logo Sekolah, Favicon, Latar Login kustom, palet warna primer/aksen, dan radius tombol/kartu).</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Mengubah tampilan antarmuka (Navbar, Halaman Login, PDF Raport, Kartu Santri) dan file manifest PWA mobile secara instan.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Tenant Audit Logs (`/tenancy/audit-logs`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Rekam jejak keamanan (*audit trail*) atas setiap aktivitas perubahan data penting oleh staf sekolah.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Merekam aksi modifikasi pada Keuangan, Penghapusan Data Santri, dan Perubahan Nilai.</li></ul><hr class="my-6 border-slate-200"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-50/80 border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl mb-4 mt-8 flex items-center gap-2">6. Menu: Billing &amp; Paket</h2><ul class="space-y-4 mb-6"><li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Paket Langganan (`/billing/plans`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Mengelola skema paket SaaS (*Starter, Pro, Enterprise*), harga bulanan/tahunan, dan limit kapasitas.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Menentukan modul yang otomatis terbuka untuk sekolah di Module Registry.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Langganan Sekolah (`/billing/school-subscriptions`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Mengelola status masa aktif sewa platform per sekolah (*active, trialing, expired, suspended*).</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Menjadi saklar utama pembatasan akses ke seluruh fitur operasional sekolah.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Override Modul (`/billing/module-overrides`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Memberikan pengecualian khusus untuk membuka/mengunci modul tertentu pada sekolah tertentu di luar paket standarnya.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Menimpa (*override*) aturan paket standar pada ModuleAccessService.</li></ul><hr class="my-6 border-slate-200"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-50/80 border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl mb-4 mt-8 flex items-center gap-2">7. Menu: Tahfizh</h2><ul class="space-y-4 mb-6"><li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Dashboard Laporan Tahfizh (`/reports/tahfizh/dashboard`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Menampilkan grafik performa hafalan sekolah, tren setoran harian, santri teraktif, dan persentase pencapaian target.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Menerima feed data dari seluruh Setoran Hafalan dan Target Tahfizh.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Setoran Hafalan (`/tahfizh/hafalan-records`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Riwayat buku setoran lengkap (*ziyadah &amp; muraja&#039;ah*) santri beserta riwayat nilai kelancaran, fashahah, dan tajwid.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Terhubung ke Portal Santri dan Portal Wali secara live.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Input Setoran (`/tahfizh/hafalan-records/create`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Antarmuka cepat bagi asatidz untuk mencatat hafalan baru santri per ayat/halaman hanya dalam beberapa detik.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> <div class="ml-4 mt-1 text-xs text-indigo-800 list-disc flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-400"></span>Mengurangi saldo **Hutang Tahfizh** secara otomatis.</div><div class="ml-4 mt-1 text-xs text-indigo-800 list-disc flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-400"></span>Mengisi checklist pada **Mutabaah Yaumiyah**.</div><li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Target Hafalan (`/tahfizh/targets`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Menetapkan target hafalan wajib santri (contoh: 1 halaman/hari, 1 juz/bulan).</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Menjadi tolok ukur perhitungan Hutang Hafalan.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Hutang Hafalan (`/tahfizh/debts`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Memantau santri yang belum memenuhi kuota target hafalan periodik dan akumulasi tanggungan setoran.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Mengirimkan sinyal peringatan ke Portal Wali Santri dan bahan evaluasi di AI Practice Plan.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Laporan Bulanan &amp; Triwulan (`/reports/tahfizh/monthly` &amp; `/reports/tahfizh/quarterly`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Merekap data hafalan dalam format siap cetak PDF / Ekspor Excel sebagai Raport Tahfizh resmi.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Menggunakan branding logo dan kop dari White-Label.</li></ul><hr class="my-6 border-slate-200"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-50/80 border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl mb-4 mt-8 flex items-center gap-2">8. Menu: Mutabaah</h2><ul class="space-y-4 mb-6"><li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Dashboard Laporan Mutabaah (`/mutabaah/reports/dashboard`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Visualisasi grafik ketaatan ibadah santri (sholat 5 waktu, tilawah, dzikir, dhuha, tahajjud, puasa sunnah).</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Merekap data dari Input Mutabaah dan Student 360° Profile.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Input Mutabaah (`/mutabaah/daily`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Checklist harian amalan yaumiyah santri (dapat diisi oleh santri, guru, atau musyrif asrama).</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Terintegrasi langsung dengan Portal Wali Santri untuk pemantauan karakter dari rumah.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Kelola Aktivitas (`/mutabaah/activities`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Menambah, menyunting, atau menonaktifkan poin-poin ibadah dan pembiasaan adab yang dinilai.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Memperbarui form input di Input Mutabaah.</li></ul><hr class="my-6 border-slate-200"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-50/80 border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl mb-4 mt-8 flex items-center gap-2">9. Menu: Kehadiran (Attendance)</h2><ul class="space-y-4 mb-6"><li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Dashboard Laporan Kehadiran (`/attendance/reports/dashboard`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Analitik persentase presensi santri (Hadir, Sakit, Izin, Alpa) per sesi dan per kelas.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Terhubung ke Student 360° Profile dan evaluasi kedisiplinan.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Kartu QR Siswa (`/attendance/qr-cards`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Cetak massal kartu santri ber-QR code dengan token keamanan kriptografis dinamis.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Mengambil data santri dari Master Data dan branding dari White-Label.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Scanner Kehadiran (`/attendance/scanner`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Pemindai kamera langsung (laptop webcam / HP) untuk absensi presensi dalam hitungan milidetik.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Menulis catatan presensi ke Sesi Kehadiran dan memicu notifikasi kehadiran.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Input Manual (`/attendance/manual/create`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Penginputan atau koreksi presensi santri secara manual jika berhalangan scan QR.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Terhubung ke perizinan pada modul Boarding (Asrama).<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Sesi Kehadiran (`/attendance/sessions`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Pengaturan jadwal dan jenis sesi presensi (KBM Pagi, Halaqah Shubuh, Sholat Ashar, Apel Malam).</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Menjadi wadah pengelompokan data log scanner.</li></ul><hr class="my-6 border-slate-200"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-50/80 border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl mb-4 mt-8 flex items-center gap-2">10. Menu: Tahsin</h2><ul class="space-y-4 mb-6"><li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Dashboard Laporan Tahsin (`/tahsin/reports/dashboard`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Grafik sebaran santri berdasarkan jilid/tingkat kemahiran membaca Al-Qur&#039;an.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Terkoneksi ke Student 360° Profile.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Profil Tahsin Siswa (`/tahsin/profiles`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Riwayat individual santri mencakup jilid saat ini, tanggal kenaikan tingkat, dan catatan ustadz penguji.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Menjadi rujukan kesiapan santri sebelum diizinkan masuk ke Target Tahfizh.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Penilaian Siswa (Asesmen) (`/tahsin/assessments`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Formulir ujian kelulusan jilid/tingkat tahsin dengan rubrik penilaian makhraj, tajwid, dan kelancaran.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Terbit di Portal Santri dan Portal Orang Tua.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Kelola Jenjang &amp; Keterampilan (`/tahsin/levels` &amp; `/tahsin/skills`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Mengatur tingkatan tahsin (Jilid 1 s.d. Al-Qur&#039;an Besar) serta indikator kompetensi tajwidnya.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Menjadi opsi rubrik pada Penilaian Siswa.</li></ul><hr class="my-6 border-slate-200"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-50/80 border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl mb-4 mt-8 flex items-center gap-2">11. Menu: LMS Belajar</h2><ul class="space-y-4 mb-6"><li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Dashboard LMS (`/lms`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Ringkasan kelas online aktif, jumlah materi terbit, dan tugas yang membutuhkan penilaian guru.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Terhubung dengan Data Master Guru &amp; Siswa.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Kursus Belajar (`/lms/courses`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Manajemen kelas mata pelajaran/diniyah, silabus materi video/dokumen, penugasan santri, dan kuis online.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> <div class="ml-4 mt-1 text-xs text-indigo-800 list-disc flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-400"></span>Santri mengakses dan mengumpulkan tugas di **Portal Santri**.</div><div class="ml-4 mt-1 text-xs text-indigo-800 list-disc flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-400"></span>Nilai tugas terpantau di **Portal Wali Santri**.</div><li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Laporan Progress LMS (`/lms/reports`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Rekapitulasi nilai tugas, skor kuis, dan persentase penyelesaian materi belajar santri.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Mengisi data rekam akademik pada Student 360° Profile.</li></ul><hr class="my-6 border-slate-200"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-50/80 border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl mb-4 mt-8 flex items-center gap-2">12. Menu: Keuangan</h2><ul class="space-y-4 mb-6"><li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Dashboard Laporan Keuangan (`/finance/reports/dashboard`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Visualisasi arus kas masuk SPP, total piutang/tunggakan santri, dan rekapitulasi penerimaan per pos biaya.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Mengagregasi data dari seluruh Tagihan Siswa dan Pembayaran Siswa.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Tagihan Siswa (`/finance/bills`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Penerbitan invoice biaya berkala (SPP Bulanan, Uang Gedung, Uang Makan, Seragam) per santri atau rombel.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Muncul transparan pada menu Keuangan Anak di Portal Wali Santri.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Pembayaran Siswa (`/finance/payments`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Pencatatan transaksi pelunasan tagihan, verifikasi bukti transfer, dan cetak kwitansi resmi.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Mengubah status tagihan menjadi lunas dan mencatat kas masuk ke Buku Kas / General Ledger.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Kategori &amp; Item Biaya (`/finance/fee-categories` &amp; `/finance/fee-items`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Master jenis dan tarif biaya yang berlaku di sekolah.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Menjadi acuan pembuatan invoice di Tagihan Siswa.</li></ul><hr class="my-6 border-slate-200"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-50/80 border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl mb-4 mt-8 flex items-center gap-2">13. Menu: Cashless System (Kantin &amp; Smart Card)</h2><ul class="space-y-4 mb-6"><li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Dashboard Laporan Cashless (`/cashless/reports/dashboard`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Ringkasan perputaran uang non-tunai di kantin, volume transaksi, dan omzet per merchant.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Terhubung dengan transaksi POS Kasir dan Wallet Santri.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Merchant &amp; Produk Merchant (`/cashless/merchants` &amp; `/cashless/products`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Master stan kantin/koperasi, daftar makanan/minuman/kitab, harga, dan manajemen inventaris.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Menjadi katalog menu pada antarmuka POS Kasir.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Wallet Santri (`/cashless/wallets`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Pengelolaan saldo dompet digital santri, status kartu, dan pengaturan limit belanja harian.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Orang tua dapat memantau saldo dan riwayat jajan santri di Portal Wali Santri.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Top Up Wallet (`/cashless/top-ups/create`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Penambahan saldo dompet santri oleh kasir atau via setor tunai.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Dapat diintegrasikan ke invoice penagihan pada Modul Finance.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Refund / Void (`/cashless/refunds/create`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Pembatalan transaksi salah input atau pengembalian saldo santri.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Mengembalikan saldo ke Wallet Santri dan mencatat jurnal koreksi.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Settlement (`/cashless/settlements`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Rekonsiliasi dan pencairan dana bagi hasil dari rekening bersama sekolah ke pengelola kantin.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Terhubung ke pencatatan kas keluar di Modul Finance.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>POS Kasir &amp; Session POS (`/cashless/pos/cashier` &amp; `/cashless/pos-sessions`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Antarmuka kasir layar sentuh (*touchscreen-friendly*) untuk transaksi cepat dengan scan kartu dan verifikasi PIN.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Memotong saldo Wallet Santri seketika.</li></ul><hr class="my-6 border-slate-200"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-50/80 border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl mb-4 mt-8 flex items-center gap-2">14. Menu: Boarding (Manajemen Asrama)</h2><ul class="space-y-4 mb-6"><li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Dashboard Boarding (`/boarding`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Ringkasan okupansi ranjang asrama, daftar santri yang sedang izin di luar, santri sakit, dan apel kamar malam.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Mengagregasi data dari seluruh sub-fitur asrama.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Asrama, Kamar, &amp; Ranjang (`/boarding/dormitories`, `/boarding/rooms`, `/boarding/beds`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Master gedung asrama (putra/putri), denah kamar, dan kapasitas tempat tidur.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Menjadi lokasi penempatan santri di Penempatan Santri.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Penempatan Santri (`/boarding/assignments`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Alokasi santri ke nomor kamar/ranjang tertentu dan penugasan musyrif pembina kamar.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Mengambil data santri dari Master Data Siswa.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Perizinan Santri (`/boarding/leave-requests`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Alur pengajuan izin keluar/pulang santri, persetujuan musyrif/kepala asrama, dan tiket digital pos satpam (*Gate Pass*).</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> <div class="ml-4 mt-1 text-xs text-indigo-800 list-disc flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-400"></span>Diajukan dan dipantau oleh wali santri di **Portal Wali**.</div><div class="ml-4 mt-1 text-xs text-indigo-800 list-disc flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-400"></span>Memvalidasi absensi santri pada **Modul Presensi Kehadiran**.</div></li></ul><hr class="my-6 border-slate-200"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-50/80 border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl mb-4 mt-8 flex items-center gap-2">15. Menu: SaaS Ops (Khusus Pengelola Platform)</h2><ul class="space-y-4 mb-6"><li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Scale Dashboard (`/saas-ops`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Monitoring utilisasi serverless, volume traffic data, dan kesehatan multi-tenant sekolah.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Memantau beban kerja database dan integrasi API seluruh sekolah.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Plans, School Subs, &amp; Invoices (`/saas-ops/subscription-plans`, dll.)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Operasional komersial paket langganan dan penagihan B2B antar penyedia platform dengan pihak sekolah.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Mengontrol status buka/tutup lisensi sekolah di Billing.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Tickets, Incidents, &amp; Releases (`/saas-ops/support-tickets`, dll.)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Helpdesk penerimaan komplain admin sekolah, manajemen respon insiden bug/down, dan publikasi versi baru (*Release Notes*).</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Menjaga SLA layanan untuk seluruh admin tenant.</li></ul><hr class="my-6 border-slate-200"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-50/80 border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl mb-4 mt-8 flex items-center gap-2">16. Menu: Developer Portal</h2><ul class="space-y-4 mb-6"><li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Dev Dashboard (`/developer-portal/dashboard`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Ringkasan performa integrasi API, total request harian, dan metrik throughput webhook.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Memonitor koneksi sistem pihak ketiga ke database platform.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>API Clients (`/developer-portal/api-clients`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Pembuatan dan manajemen Client ID serta Secret Token API dengan pembatasan hak akses (*Bearer Scopes*).</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Jalur aman integrasi data Tahfizh, Kehadiran, dan Keuangan ke aplikasi mobile luar, bot WhatsApp, atau mesin fisik.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>API Docs (`/developer-portal/docs`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Dokumentasi teknis OpenAPI interaktif (endpoint REST, parameter request, dan contoh response JSON).</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Panduan bagi developer mitra integrasi sekolah.</li></ul><hr class="my-6 border-slate-200"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-800 bg-emerald-50/80 border border-emerald-200 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl mb-4 mt-8 flex items-center gap-2">17. Menu: Portal Wali (Khusus Akun Orang Tua)</h2><ul class="space-y-4 mb-6"><li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Progres Tahfizh (`/portal/parent/dashboard`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Melihat capaian juz hafalan anak, grafik setoran, dan status kelancaran harian secara realtime.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Terhubung langsung ke modul Tahfizh (Hafalan Records).<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Mutabaah Anak (`/portal/parent/mutabaah/{id}`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Melihat checklist ibadah harian anak di asrama/sekolah.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Terhubung ke modul Mutabaah.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Kehadiran Anak (`/portal/parent/attendance`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Memantau absensi harian KBM dan sholat berjamaah anak.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Terhubung ke modul Attendance.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Tahsin Anak (`/portal/parent/tahsin`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Melihat perkembangan jilid dan sertifikasi tahsin anak.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Terhubung ke modul Tahsin.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Keuangan Anak (`/portal/parent/finance`)</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed pl-4 border-l-2 border-slate-300"><strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Fungsi:</strong> Mengecek rincian tagihan SPP, mengunggah bukti bayar, dan mengunduh kwitansi lunas.</div><div class="text-sm text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/80 mt-2 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-indigo-950 font-bold">🔗 Relasi Antar-Fitur:</strong> Terhubung ke modul Finance.<li class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-2"><div class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></